<title>ITALY: Olivetti unable to resume trade, next try 1011 GMT.</title>
<headline>Olivetti unable to resume trade, next try 1011 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crisis-hit Olivetti shares were unable to resume trading on the Milan stock market after being suspended limit down and a further attempt will be made at 1011 GMT, the Bourse Council said.</p>
<p>The stock was indicated at a new record low 464 lire in the price-matching procedure after earlier being suspended when it plunged to 465 lire after opening at 498 lire per share.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
